@coalition_people
title: Coalition and People

= Coalition and People

The four component prefixes are political abstractions: Iran Party, Toilers,
independent nationalists, and religious networks. Each separately tracks
strength, relationship, dissent, and organization. Mossadegh's authority is
not coalition cohesion. Kashani is represented as an independent counterpart.

Research map:
{!<a href="timeline.html#source-maj-s2">!}MAJ-S2{!</a>!}, chapter 5,
especially pp. 250–267; and
{!<a href="timeline.html#source-maj-s14">!}MAJ-S14{!</a>!}, chapter 1.

- @research_library: Library index

@chambers
title: Majles and Senate

= Majles and Senate

The ledger contains exactly 136 authorized Sixteenth-Majles places and 60
First-Senate places. Historical evidence and mutable scenario state never
overwrite one another. Unknown constituency-level evidence remains null.

Current derived totals:

* Majles returns: [+ majles_returns_recorded +] / 136
* Majles usable members: [+ majles_usable_members +]
* Usable National Front members: [+ majles_national_front_usable +]
* Senate usable members: [+ senate_usable_members +] / 60

Research map:
{!<a href="timeline.html#source-sup-051">!}SUP-051{!</a>!};
{!<a href="timeline.html#source-sup-007">!}SUP-007{!</a>!}, sessions 2–128;
and the tracked *SIXTEENTH_MAJLES_LEDGER.md*.

