@oil
title: Oil Proposals

= Oil Proposals

The game compares ownership recognition, operational control, marketing,
compensation, interim finance, personnel authority, and duration/review.
Unknown and disputed terms remain null. The March 1951 nationalization
principle does not pretend to settle the later implementation law.

Player position: [+ oil_terms_position +]

Research map:
