@events
title: Event Notes

= Event Notes

Every major scene has an adjacent claim record under `docs/research/events/`.
Those records identify the documented anchor, disputes, counterfactual choice,
mechanical abstraction, and precise source locator. Scene effects are scenario
logic, not historical measurements.

- @research_library: Library index

@uncertainty
title: Uncertainty Guide

= Uncertainty Guide

Null means unknown or disputed. Qualitative sidebar language communicates
scenario risk without false precision. Seeded variation changes only minor
report reliability and constituency pressure by at most two points per turn;
it never changes an event, date, person, fact, source confidence, or vote.

- @research_library: Library index

@bibliography
title: Bibliography

= Bibliography

Stable source IDs and assessments of expertise, standing, evidence base, and
limitations are maintained in `docs/research/BIBLIOGRAPHY.md`. The generated
{!<a href="timeline.html#source-maj-s1">!}primer bibliography{!</a>!} provides the
public reading route.

